SUMMARY:International Stroke Conference 2027
DESCRIPTION:The International Stroke Conference is the annual scientific 
 meeting of the American Stroke Association\, a division of the American 
 Heart Association\, focused on cerebrovascular disease research and clin
 ical stroke care. The 2027 conference runs February 10 to 12\, 2027\, in
  Houston\, Texas\, with pre-conference symposia held on February 9\, 202
 7.\n\nDeadlines\nAbstract submission deadline: 2026-08-18\nLate-breaking
  science submission opens: 2026-09-30\nLate-breaking science submission 
 deadline: 2026-10-28\n\nhttps://professional.heart.org/en/meetings/inter
 national-stroke-conference
LOCATION:Houston\, Texas\, George R. Brown Convention Center
URL:https://professional.heart.org/en/meetings/international-stroke-confe
 rence
